{
  "id": "adventurer_town",
  "title": "Adventurer's Rest",
  "premise": "A frontier town that lives off adventurers. The guild hands out work, the smith forges their gear from quarry stone and forest logs, the inn feeds them, and the market trades whatever they bring back. Beneath the Guild Hall lies a crypt the guildmaster sealed years ago, after his own party died there.",
